&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord is used by over 200 million people every month for many different reasons, but there’s one thing that nearly everyone does on our platform:&lt;strong&gt; play video games.&lt;/strong&gt; Over 90% of our users play games, spending a combined 1.5 billion hours playing thousands of unique titles on Discord each month. Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We are focused on making it easier and more fun for people to talk and hang out before, during, and after playing games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discord&#39;s Workplace Operations team provides a delightful, safe, and inclusive office environment for employees and visitors. As a Workplace Operations Program Manager reporting to the Senior Manager, Workplace Operations, you&#39;ll drive San Francisco HQ&#39;s daily operations—triaging tickets, optimizing vendor relationships, and collaborating on food programs and company events. You&#39;ll design engagement initiatives, improve our onsite playbook, and refine policies keeping our office running smoothly. Your work directly impacts how Discordians connect and feel supported, ensuring the belonging we create online is reflected in our workplace.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oversee vendor relationships and service delivery&lt;/strong&gt; across San Francisco HQ, managing SLA performance, troubleshooting issues, and presenting optimization recommendations while ensuring budget alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and implement employee engagement programs&lt;/strong&gt; that strengthen company culture, enhance workplace satisfaction, and creating moments of surprise and delight that reflect Discord&#39;s values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage food, beverage, and pantry programs&lt;/strong&gt; by monitoring usage, identifying improvements, and scaling operations to support growth while balancing experience with budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own daily workplace operations and employee support&lt;/strong&gt;, responding to tickets, serving as an approachable resource, and evolving our operations playbook to ensure a safe, inclusive environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop and iterate workplace policies and processes&lt;/strong&gt; that maximize operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional partners&lt;/strong&gt; including People, IT, Facilities, Security, and Finance, clearly communicating complex concepts and adjusting messaging based on stakeholder needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Internal Events, Employee Experience, and other XFN partners to execute company events&lt;/strong&gt; including all-hands and onsites, delivering mid-size projects with minimal guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in workplace operations, facilities management, or office management, with demonstrated ability to manage multiple programs and projects simultaneously in fast-paced environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor management expertise&lt;/strong&gt; including contract negotiation, SLA evaluation, and strategic service provider partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong project management skills&lt;/strong&gt; with experience executing multi-month projects independently and delivering results with minimal oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budget management experience&lt;/strong&gt; aligning operational spending with financial targets while maintaining quality employee experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent cross-functional collaboration and communication skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with ability to influence peers and navigate complex stakeholder relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical knowledge of workplace systems&lt;/strong&gt; and how facilities, furniture, and technologies integrate to support operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passion for employee experience and culture&lt;/strong&gt;, with creative problem-solving and a track record of designing initiatives that build belonging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a 9-month temporary position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Candidates must reside in or be willing to relocate to the San Francisco Bay Area (Alameda, Contra Costa, Marin, Napa, San Francisco, San Mateo, Santa Clara, Solano, and Sonoma counties). Relocation assistance may be available.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The annual US base salary range for this&amp;nbsp;temporary full-time position is &lt;strong&gt;$124,000 - $139,500&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;. &lt;/strong&gt;Our salary ranges are determined by role and level. Within the range, individual pay is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training. Please note that the compensation details listed in US role postings reflect the base salary only, and do not include benefits.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Discord?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Discord plays a uniquely important role in the future of gaming. We&#39;re a multiplatform, multigenerational and multiplayer platform that helps people deepen their friendships around games and shared interests. We believe games give us a way to have fun with our favorite people, whether listening to music together or grinding in competitive matches for diamond rank. &lt;strong&gt;Join us in our mission! Your future is just a click away!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discord is committed to inclusion and providing reasonable accommodations during the interview process. &lt;/strong&gt;We want you to feel set up for success, so if you are in need of reasonable accommodations, please let your recruiter know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please see our Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy for details regarding Discord’s collection and usage of personal information relating to the application and recruitment process by clicking&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/terms/applicant-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;HERE.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
